ent": "Accurately use information about directions to places in  a limited range of social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Zero Conditional"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the zero conditional to talk about general truths and certainties and to give instructions. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "There are two parts to the sentence.  <br><br>One part is the <span class=\"strong\">condition</span>. The other part is the <span class=\"strong\">result</span>. When you want to give an instruction, use the imperative in the main clause. <br><br>Form:<br>If  or When + subject + the Simple Present Tense/Imperative<br>You can flip the two parts of the sentence so that the result comes first.<br>Subject + The Simple Present tense/Imperative + if or when + subject + the Simple Present"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Condition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Result\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">When you learn about the local wildlife,</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">you enjoy your trip so much more.</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Result\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Condition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You enjoy your trip so much more</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">when you learn about the local wildlife.</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Notice that you only need a comma (,) if you say the condition first. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking About Geographic Features"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you talk about geographical features, you talk about natural things like bodies of water, plants, animals, and how the land looks. <br><br> Geographic features in Argentina include things like: "}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn4le17ob11img01.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn4le17ob11img02.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn4le17ob11img03.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn4le17ob11img04.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn4le17ob11img05.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn4le17ob11img06.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn4le17ob11img07.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn4le17ob11img08.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "content": "engenn4le17ob11img09.jpg"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "coastal"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "talking about the area next to the ocean"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Their main breeding ground is coastal Argentina."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le17ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words to review."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "colony"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large number of animals"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You can see large colonies of penguins."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le17ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "penguin"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a bird that lives in cold climates and cannot fly"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I saw in my guidebook that there are penguins in Argentina!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le17ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "wildlife"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "wild animals"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Be sure to keep an eye out for wildlife."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le17ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "field glasses"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "binoculars for outdoor use"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Don't forget to bring your field glasses."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le17ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "peaceful"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "calm and quiet"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It is peaceful enough for the birds to breed."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le17ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le17ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write an 8 - 10 line dialogue between you and a friend."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Describe what is new with you and \u201cthe gang\u201d."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice the dialogue with your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Switch roles and practice again."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about what is current in my life with my friends."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue about my social life."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice speaking in a dialogue."}]}], "type": "sena"}